
@startuml
title MS5 - Anti-Plagiarism Detection Pipeline

autonumber

actor "Verification Service" as MS5
participant "MS3 - Submissions" as MS3
participant "GitHub Repository" as GitHub
participant "Code Preprocessor" as Prep
participant "Gemma Embedding Model" as Gemma
database "PostgreSQL + pgvector" as DB
participant "Similarity Analyzer" as Analyzer
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "MS4 - Evaluation" as MS4

== Submission Event ==

MS3 -> MQ: submission.submitted
MQ -> MS5: Consume event\n(submissionId, repoUrl, commitSha)

== Retrieve Source Code ==

MS5 -> MS3: GET /api/submissions/{id}
MS3 --> MS5: Submission metadata

MS5 -> GitHub: Clone repository\nat fixed commitSha
GitHub --> MS5: Source code files

== Code Processing ==

MS5 -> Prep: Extract relevant source files
Prep -> Prep: Remove comments and irrelevant files
Prep -> Prep: Normalize code and split into chunks
Prep --> MS5: Code chunks + candidate metadata

== Generate Embeddings ==

loop For each code chunk and candidate
    MS5 -> Gemma: Generate embedding(text)
    Gemma --> MS5: Vector [e1, e2, ..., en]
end

== Store Vectors ==

MS5 -> DB: INSERT submission embedding\n(vector, submissionId, chunkId)
DB --> MS5: Embeddings stored

== Similarity Comparison ==

MS5 -> DB: Query candidate vectors\nusing pgvector cosine distance
DB --> MS5: Similarity scores + matching IDs

MS5 -> Analyzer: Compare scores against threshold
Analyzer -> Analyzer: Aggregate matching chunks\nCalculate similarity percentage
Analyzer --> MS5: Similarity report

== Persist Results ==

MS5 -> DB: Store PlagiatAlert\n(similarity, matched submissions)
DB --> MS5: Alert persisted

alt Similarity exceeds threshold
    MS5 -> MQ: Publish similarity.flagged
    MQ -> MS4: similarity.flagged
    note right of MS4
      Jury sees plagiarism alert
      before evaluation.
    end note
else No suspicious similarity
    MS5 -> MS5: Mark analysis as clear
end

@enduml
